@format 1
@id section-creation.set-start-creates-section
@title Set Start creates a section
@section Section creation
@area In Split tab
@entry start-dispatch
@summary Follow only the Set Start branch that creates a new section; changing the start of an existing selected section is explicitly outside this map.
@related section-creation.common.compass-buttons, section-creation.common.keyboard-shortcuts, section-creation.common.forward-section-plan, section-creation.common.apply-created-state
@tag section
@tag split
@tag creation
@tag start

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow
@alias segment = Cadroue.Application.LSegment
@alias piece = Cadroue.Core.LPiece

[start-dispatch] setStart dispatch request <input>
= The request came from the Split Compass Start button or the currently bound SectionStart shortcut.
> dispatch-guard

[dispatch-guard] Active Split flow guard <decision>
- PFlowShortcutDispatch requires a command-active flow with a loaded spool and active section UI before invoking PFlowStartSet @ flow.PFlowShortcutDispatch(...) / setStart
? "Rejected" > dispatch-rejected
? "Accepted" > start-handler

[dispatch-rejected] Set Start command ignored <output>
= No section operation is called.

[start-handler] Set Start creation preconditions <decision>
- PFlowStartSet requires section editing to be enabled plus a spool and nonblank source path, then chooses the color from current section count modulo active palette count and calls LSegmentStartSet with cursor, duration, color, and overlap policy @ flow.PFlowStartSet(...)
@ flow.PFlowColorRead(...)
@ property flow.PFlowOverlapAllowed
? "Editing disabled or media/source unavailable" > start-rejected
? "Preconditions accepted" > segment-start

[start-rejected] Set Start creation blocked <output>
= No section state changes.

[segment-start] Evaluate selected-section relationship <decision>
- LSegmentStartSet delegates to LPieceStartSet; creation occurs only when no section is selected or the selected section ends strictly before the current cursor @ segment.LSegmentStartSet(...)
@ piece.LPieceStartSet(...)
? "No selection or selected end before cursor" > forward-create
? "Existing-section branch" > existing-start-outside

[existing-start-outside] Existing-section start path excluded <output>
= This branch either rejects the requested start or edits an existing section; both are outside the requested creation-only scope.

[forward-create] Delegate creation to LPieceAdd <process>
- LPieceStartSet uses LPieceAdd to build a new forward-running section and reports Added=true only if that plan succeeds @ piece.LPieceStartSet(...) / LPieceAdd creation branch
@ piece.LPieceAdd(...)
> map:section-creation.common.forward-section-plan
